cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pksProfiler, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "pksProfiler: detection and genome-resolved analysis of the pks (colibactin) island"
abstract: >-
  A Nextflow pipeline that detects the pks pathogenicity island in tumour and metagenome
  sequencing data, scores the strength of the evidence, reconstructs the island from its own
  reads, identifies the bacterium carrying it, and describes the surrounding community.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Alexandrov Lab, University of California San Diego"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AlexandrovLab/pksProfiler"
license: BSD-2-Clause
version: 0.0.2dev
keywords:
  - colibactin
  - pks island
  - metagenomics
  - cancer genomics
  - mutational signatures
  - Nextflow
